    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Sarath Amunugama,Minister of Higher Education and Research on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by this Orderamend the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1454/37 of July 22, 2006, as amended from time to time, whichspecifies the Faculties and Departments of the University of Kelaniya, Sri Lanka, by the addition immediately after item 8 inColumn II which corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of Social Sciences\u201d in Column I, in the Schedule to such Order, of thefollowing new item :-",
